OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after motorcyclist
OL,4,Adies in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for witnesses
OL,7,Fafter a man died in a crash involving a
OL,8,Fcar and a motorcycle in Leicestershire.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to the junction of
OL,11,FRugby Road and Brookside, in Burbage,
OL,12,Fjust after 15:00 BST on Saturday,
OL,13,FLeicestershire Police said.
OL,15,FThe rider of a silver AP Tuono V4
OL,16,Fmotorcycle, a man in his 30s, was
OL,17,Fpronounced dead at the scene of the
OL,18,Fcrash, said the force.
OL,20,FThe driver of a grey Jaecoo 5 car
OL,21,Finvolved was not injured and no-one was
OL,22,Farrested, officers added.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
